    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.3', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS，this is M/V (name). Information received. Question: What is the anchor position for me? over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名），信息明白。问：我的锚位在哪？'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.4', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. Answer: Anchor position ... allocated to you. out.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS，...锚位是安排给你的。通话完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.5', category: 'movement', en: '..VTS ，this is M/V (name). Information: My anchoring is completed time: ... hours local. Over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名），信息：我在当地时间...点抛锚完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.6', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. Your information received. out.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS，信息收到。通话完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.7', category: 'movement', en: '..VTS ，this is M/V (name). I think that this anchorage position is not safe because current is very strong. do I have permission to shift my anchorage position to ...?', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名），我认为这个锚位不安全，因为流很急。我能移到...位置抛锚吗？'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.8', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. yes , you have permission to shift anchorage position to .… no, you do not have permission to shift your anchorage position. ...（position）is allocated to another vessel. Advice: put more shackles in the water. out.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。你可以移到那个位置抛锚。你不可以移到那个位置抛锚，那个锚位已经安排给他船了。建议你多松几节锚链入水。通话完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.9', category: 'movement', en: '.VTS ，this is M/V (name). question: do I have permission to heave up anchor now? over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名）。问题：我现在可以起锚吗？'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.10', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. answer: ~ you have permission to heave up anchor. over. ~ you do not have permission to heave up anchor. please wait for vessel(name)to clear position near you, before you get underway. over.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。回答：~你可以起锚。~你现在不可以起锚，请等到你附近的...船（船名）让清你后再起锚'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.11', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is M/V (name).message understood. I will wait. over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名）。信息收到。我会等待'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.1', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. you have permission to heave up anchor. over.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。你可以起锚了'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.12', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is M/V (name). Message received. Question: what time may I enter the lock? over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名）。信息收到。问：我什么时候可以进入船闸？'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.13', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. ~ you will enter lock at ...hours local. over. ~ you must wait for lock clearance at ... (position) . over.', zh: '....船，我是...VTS。~你在地方时...点钟可以进入船闸。~你在...（位置）等候直到船闸清了为止'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.14', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is M/V (name). Message understood. I will wait. over.', zh: '....VTS，我是...船（船名）。信息收到。我会等待'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.15', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. you have permission to enter lock, your station in convoy is number...,you must close up on vessel ahead of you. over.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。你可以进入船闸了，你在编队的位置是...号，你必须紧跟你前面的船'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.16', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is M/V (name). Message understood. out.', zh: '....VTS，我是...船（船名）。信息收到。通知完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.17', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is M/V (name). Question: what are my berthing instructions?over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名）。问：有我的靠泊指令吗？'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.18', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. answer: ~ no information about your berthing instructions. over. ~ you will berth at ...hours local. over.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。~没有你船靠泊的信息。~你将在当地时间...点钟靠码头'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.19', category: 'movement', en: 'VTS ，this is M/V (name). My berthing is completed at berth number..., time: ...hours local. over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名）。我在当地时间...点钟在...泊位靠泊完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.20', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. Message understood. out.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。信息收到。通话完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.21', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is M/V (name).I have finished unloading, do I have permission to shift to berth number... for loading?', zh: '...VTS，我是...船（船名）。我卸货完毕。我可以移到...泊位去装货吗？'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.1.22', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. you have permission to shift to berth number.… you must wait for M/V...to clear before you leaving the berth.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。你可以移到...泊位。你必须等到...船（船名）让清你后才可以离码头'),
