    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.2.1', category: 'movement', en: 'VTS ，this is oil tanker (name). I am the discharging vessel the receiving ship(name) has finished mooring. Ship to ship transfer operation will start in ...hours', zh: '...VTS，我是...油船（船名）。我是母船，接驳船（船名）已靠妥我船，船过船过驳作业将在...小时后开始'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.2.2', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. information received. out.', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。信息收到。通话完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.2.3', category: 'movement', en: '...VTS ，this is oil tanker (name). Pumping start ship to ship transfer operation will be finished in ... hours. over.', zh: '...VTS，我是...油船（船名）。已开泵，船过船过驳作业将在...小时内结束'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.2.4', category: 'movement', en: 'M/V(name),this is ...VTS. information received out', zh: '...船，我是...VTS。信息收到。通话完毕'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.2.5', category: 'movement', en: '..VTS ，this is oil tanker (name). Ship to ship transfer operation finished. Receiving ship unmooring completed at ... hours local.', zh: '...VTS，我是...油船（船名）。船过船过驳作业已结束，接驳船在当地时间...点钟离开我船'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '1.3', category: 'movement', en: 'Acquiring and providing routine traffic data', zh: '获取和提供常规交通用语P18'),
