    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.2.1.1', category: 'mooring', en: 'MV…on fire/ had explosion./ in collision (with .. )./ flooded./ sinking./ listing / in danger of capsizing. in position….', zh: '在...处...船舶发生火灾/发生爆炸/（与...）碰撞/进水/正在下沉/正在横倾/有倾覆的危险'),
