    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.2.2.11', category: 'mooring', en: 'It is dangerous to approach…, You must anchor Anchor position …degrees,…miles from light house has been allocated to you.', zh: '接近...会很危险。你船必须抛锚，给你指定的锚位是离...灯塔方位...度、距离...海里'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.2.2.12', category: 'mooring', en: 'LNG-tanker/LPG-tanker…leaking gas in position…. Avoid passing to leeward.', zh: '…液化天然气/液化石油气船在…处泄漏气体，请不要在下风通过'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.2.2.13', category: 'mooring', en: 'You may anchor until unknown objects is removed', zh: '你船可抛锚直到不明物体清除'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.2.2.14', category: 'mooring', en: 'Warning cancel, traffic clearance again.', zh: '警告解除，恢复通航'),
