    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.3.3', category: 'mooring', en: 'Visibility is reduced by fog/mist/dust/rain/snow/…', zh: '由于有雾/霾/灰尘/雨/雪/...，能见度降低'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.3.4', category: 'mooring', en: 'Visibility is increasing / decreasing / variable.', zh: '能见度增加/降低/变化不定'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.3.6', category: 'mooring', en: 'Visibility is expected to be variable between ... meters / nautical miles in your position / in position ... ( within the next hours).', zh: '预计（在未来数小时内）在你船处/在...处的能见度在...米/海里之间变化不定'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '5.3.7', category: 'mooring', en: 'Attention All vessels. This is …VTS ,Visibility is reduced by fog. Visibility is expected to decrease to … meters. you should proceed with great caution. out.', zh: '各轮请注意，这里是...交管中心，由于雾的影响，预计能见度将减至...米，各轮应谨慎航行'),
