    MaritimePhrase(id: '7.1.3.17', category: 'general', en: 'There are still ... lifeboats / liferafts with survivors. no more lifeboats / liferafts.', zh: '仍然有...艘载有幸存者的救生艇/筏。没有更多艘载有幸存者的救生艇/筏'),
    MaritimePhrase(id: '7.1.3.18', category: 'general', en: 'All persons / ... persons rescued.', zh: '所有人员/...人员已救起'),
