    MaritimePhrase(id: '7.2.1.14', category: 'general', en: '... (number) barrels / drums / containers with IMDG - Code marks reported adrift near position... .', zh: '据报标有国际危规的...（数字）个桶/集装箱在...位置附近漂浮'),
